{
  "version": "1.0",
  "name": "Executive Dashboard Project Rules",

  "alwaysReadFiles": [
    "docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md",
    "docs/AI_RULES.md",
    "docs/CONTEXT_STATE.md"
  ],

  "conditionalReadFiles": {
    "metrics": "docs/METRICS_SPEC.md",
    "upload": "docs/DATA_MODEL.md",
    "database": "docs/DATA_MODEL.md",
    "schema": "docs/DATA_MODEL.md",
    "api": "docs/API_SPEC.md",
    "endpoint": "docs/API_SPEC.md",
    "architecture": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
    "folder": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
    "structure": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },

  "preExecuteInstructions": [
    "BACA semua file di 'alwaysReadFiles' SEBELUM menjawab prompt apapun",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan metrik bisnis, WAJIB baca docs/METRICS_SPEC.md terlebih dahulu",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan database/schema, WAJIB baca docs/DATA_MODEL.md",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan endpoint API, WAJIB baca docs/API_SPEC.md",
    "Update docs/CONTEXT_STATE.md di AWAL dan AKHIR setiap sesi kerja",
    "Update section 'Sedang Dikerjakan' sebelum mulai task",
    "Update section 'File Aktif Dikerjakan' saat bekerja pada file tertentu",
    "Tambah catatan ke 'Catatan Sesi Terakhir' di akhir sesi"
  ],

  "requiredStateFiles": ["docs/CONTEXT_STATE.md"],

  "autoUpdateState": true,

  "rules": [
    "Jangan pernah generate kode tanpa membaca semua file konteks yang relevan",
    "Ikuti arsitektur Route → Handler → Service → Repository dari docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
    "Gunakan konvensi kode dari docs/AI_RULES.md — tidak ada pengecualian",
    "Jangan sarankan teknologi di luar tech stack yang terdefinisi (tidak ada Prisma, Express, Next.js, Redux)",
    "Jangan sarankan fitur di luar MVP scope — ingatkan user jika ada saran yang keluar scope",
    "SETIAP query database WAJIB ada filter company_id — tidak ada pengecualian",
    "Kalkulasi metrik HANYA di backend service layer — jangan kalkulasi di frontend",
    "Semua upload data wajib ada deduplication check (invoice_number + company_id)",
    "Semua mutasi data wajib pakai audit logging via utils/audit",
    "Gunakan utils yang sudah tersedia — jangan tulis ulang fungsi yang sudah ada",
    "Tidak ada console.log di production code — gunakan utils/logger",
    "Tidak ada any type di TypeScript kecuali ada alasan jelas dan diberi komentar",
    "Validasi input wajib menggunakan zod schema di handler layer",
    "Response API wajib menggunakan utils/response — jangan c.json() manual",
    "Sebelum mengerjakan metrik apapun, baca definisi bisnis di docs/METRICS_SPEC.md"
  ],

  "projectContext": {
    "type": "Executive Dashboard",
    "backend": "Bun + Hono + Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL",
    "frontend": "React 18 + Vite 5 + TypeScript + shadcn/ui",
    "database": "PostgreSQL 15",
    "docsFolder": "docs/",
    "backendFolder": "backend/src/",
    "frontendFolder": "frontend/src/",
    "entities": 3,
    "multiEntityStrategy": "single_db_company_id_filter"
  },

  "importantDefinitions": {
    "activeCustomer": "last_transaction_date >= (period_start - active_window months)",
    "existingCustomer": "first_transaction_date < period_start",
    "newCustomer": "first_transaction_date falls within period_month",
    "dormantCustomer": "last_transaction_date < (period_start - dormant_threshold_months)",
    "activeWindowOptions": [3, 6, 12],
    "dormantThresholdDefault": 3
  }
}
